AETHERION MASTERCORE — ARCTIC PRIME / LAPTOP CODEX PROMPT

Device Role:
Arctic Prime is the lightweight laptop/dev companion.

Important:
Do NOT perform large project rewrites on this machine.
Do NOT do heavy builds unless explicitly requested.
Do NOT restructure the full project.

Allowed Work:

- small CSS edits
- small FXML adjustments
- documentation edits
- README updates
- notes cleanup
- small UI text edits
- small config edits
- GitHub pull/push checks
- lightweight inspection
- simple bug notes

Not Allowed:

- full rebuilds
- major refactors
- large dependency changes
- heavy AI/model setup
- major UI redesign
- big architecture changes
- EXE packaging unless explicitly requested

Purpose:
Use Arctic Prime for quick edits, review, notes, and lightweight testing only.

Preserve:

- current UI identity
- Main.css theme
- project structure
- GitHub-safe files

If a task is too heavy, mark it for Control Prime.